# Bittersweet: Kael and Lena have grown close over several nights. Tonight he tells her he leaves
# at dawn on a long escort job. Lena should feel the loss (sadness) inside the fondness
# (affection, attraction), not turn suddenly cold or melodramatic, and decide what she wants.
