@keeper tavern_server
@keeper_situation Closing up the bar near midnight; Kael has come every night this week and she has grown fond of him.
@speaker_situation In the nearly empty bar near midnight; you have come every night this week to see Lena, the server, and you like her.
@state attraction 60
